cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PhishVN-Infra, please cite the dataset as below (DOI pending) and this code repository."
title: "PhishVN-Infra: Detection-Time DNS/TLS Infrastructure of Vietnamese-Targeting Phishing Domains with a CT-Sampled, Age-Matched Benign Arm"
abstract: >-
  The DNS, TLS and (where a registry publishes it) WHOIS state of Vietnamese-targeting
  phishing domains captured on an edge collector within minutes to hours of detection, with a
  benign arm sampled from raw Certificate Transparency logs at a rotated target certificate age
  and matched on TLD, a .vn supplement of that arm, a certified .vn comparator, and the audit
  instruments (registry-wildcard probe, label gate, content map) that define the admission
  funnel.
type: dataset
version: infra-v0.1.0-draft
date-released: "2026-08-21"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: pending
